# Introduction

<p class="lead">This is where the <strong>Llama Brand</strong> is drawn: the icon, Llama Sans and Llama Mono, the colours, and how posts, posters, release images, link previews and swag are made from them. Everything in it is the real file or font from this repository, so what you see here is what ships.</p>

## In short

The brand that every Llama product is built on, next to the files it draws: the logo and its every file to download, the type family, the palette, and the communications made with them, for the people and agents who make Llama's posts, pages and products.

<Figure n={1} caption="The building blocks, from the bottom: the Llama Brand, here, at the base; Llama UI and Llama Chat, in llama.cpp, built on it. The communications are made from the brand and the app.">
	<Stack />
</Figure>

