## How it fits together

<Figure n={4} caption="The products and their repositories. llama-brand, this one, supplies the brand; llama.cpp holds the engine, Llama UI in ui/lib/ui and Llama Chat in ui/apps/chat; the native apps run llama-server and open Llama Chat. llama.app shows models the way Llama Chat does.">
	<Products />
</Figure>

The pages that show Llama Chat itself (Communications' direction, the store screenshots and scenes, and Philosophy's Ideology and Design) are in llama.cpp's Storybook, next to the app, and so are Llama UI's components and tokens.

